# Update Docs After Every Change

After completing ANY implementation work in this project:

1. Update `TODO.md` — check off completed tasks, add newly discovered tasks
2. Update `docs/quality.md` — update grade for the domain you changed
3. Update `specs/README.md` — update verification status if you tested a spec
4. Update the relevant spec if behavior diverged from spec during implementation

This is NON-NEGOTIABLE. Code changes without doc updates are INCOMPLETE work.
